+| `test` | [Inspect a status bit](#test) | [TEST](https://cdrdv2-public.intel.com/929352/325383-093-sdm-vol-2abcd.pdf#page=1424) |
+| `jmp` | [Skip a path](#jmp) | [JMP](https://cdrdv2-public.intel.com/929352/325383-093-sdm-vol-2abcd.pdf#page=622) |
